Slide 2 – Summary of Requirements (Req 1, 2 & 3)

Codex Capability Overview

Req 1 – AI-Assisted Reauthoring & Evaluation

Enable SMEs to semi-automate procedure reauthoring by:
	•	Rewriting documents into simplified, consistent format
	•	Quantitatively evaluating differences between source and reauthored versions
	•	Identifying potential information gaps
	•	Supporting human-in-the-loop approval workflow

Success Target:
70% initial reauthoring accuracy + 80% gap detection coverage

⸻

Req 2 – Knowledge Graph v1 (Procedures & Supporting Docs)

Create an ontology-aligned knowledge base by:
	•	Extracting structured artefacts from procedures
	•	Building a governed knowledge graph
	•	Combining graph + vector retrieval for query use cases
	•	Providing traceable, evidence-backed answers

Success Target:
80% accuracy against SME-aligned test questions

⸻

Req 3 – Knowledge Graph v2 (Policies + Lineage + Evolution)

Extend Codex into an enterprise knowledge platform by:
	•	Incorporating policies alongside procedures
	•	Establishing policy–procedure lineage
	•	Supporting ontology evolution and versioning
	•	Enabling scalable, managed API-based knowledge access

